 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Who does the action",
     "texto": [
      "The active present participle is formed from imperfective verbs. A practical clue is the 3rd person plural: **читать — читают — читающий**. Depending on the conjugation, **-ущ-/-ющ-** or **-ащ-/-ящ-** appears.",
      "It agrees with the noun in gender, number and case: **читающий человек**, **вижу читающего человека**, **о читающем человеке**. The noun is the one who performs the action.",
      "«Present» means it is based on the non-past and expresses an action simultaneous with that of the main verb; it does not necessarily mean «now». Not every imperfective verb has a participle in natural use."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Equivalence with «который»",
     "texto": [
      "It can replace a relative clause with **который**: **человек, читающий газету** = **человек, который читает газету**.",
      "If the participial phrase comes after the noun, it is usually separated by a comma; if it comes before, usually not: **читающий газету человек**. In conversation **который** is usually preferred."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
